  "3341|bdd68929": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Gann Stonespire",
   "npc": "3341",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I walk this road alone, seeking ways to defend my honor and rid this land of our enemies.\n\nWhat can I do for you, $N?",
   "time": 1791671726,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3429|4e7d06f7": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Thork",
   "npc": "3429",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Welcome to the Crossroads, $c. My name is Thork--I lead the defenses here in the name of the Warchief.\n\nPlease, feel free to make yourself at home. As long as you mind your business, no one should have any problem with you taking up some space.\n\nThere are many threats to our safety here. If you've already become familiar with the lay of the land, speak to the others here--perhaps they have tasks for you to do.",
   "time": 1791677482,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3432|c1a3099b": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mankrik",
   "npc": "3432",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "I came to the Crossroads from the south seeking help, $c, but I find only cowards who turn their backs on me--even the mighty Thork insults me so. He is a good leader, but his dismissal of my plea causes me greater anger.\n\nHe claims my rage makes me hasty--that it clouds my judgement--but I will not rest until I have vengeance!",
   "time": 1791667087,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3442|6812c5a7": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Sputtervalve",
   "npc": "3442",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Interesting, interesting... I know of a druid that lives atop the hill above the Wailing Caverns, $N. She might be able to tell you more about this shard you have found.\n\nNow, I must get back to work!",
   "time": 1791684152,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3442|ef9d74c5": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Sputtervalve",
   "npc": "3442",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Director Riddlevox put me in charge of the Union's shredder development program. Few months on the job and I'm already in hot water! I could use your help, $N!",
   "time": 1791684149,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3446|36457281": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "greeting",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Mebok Mizzyrix",
   "npc": "3446",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Yes yes yes!  You're just the $r I'm looking for!\n\nSit!  We have much to discuss!!",
   "time": 1791684138,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "3448|dcea3712": {
   "build": "70338",
   "class": "Mage",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "gossip",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1413,
   "name": "Tonga Runetotem",
   "npc": "3448",
   "questID": null,
   "race": "Orc",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "The times we live in are as fickle as the shifting winds, $c.  It is important to remember what is true and lasting in this world, and to preserve that.  Everything else is a waste.",
   "time": 1791668534,
   "title": null,
   "wanted": null,
   "zone": "The Barrens"
  },
  "5769|c9ae2675": {
